    {"claim": "The live question is one thing only: can a detect-then-suspend loop close faster than an irreversible fork propagates?", "targets": ["AN-18"]},
    {"claim": "The Accelerationist must show the suspension window stays open through the irreversible step.", "targets": ["AN-18"]}
  ]
